OL,3,AUK 'effectively blind' to early Covid
OL,4,Aspread due to lack of test and trace,
OL,5,Ainquiry finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FFailings in testing and tracing left
OL,8,Fthe UK "effectively blind" to how
OL,9,Fquickly Covid was spreading early in
OL,10,Fthe pandemic, the UK Covid Inquiry
OL,11,Ffinds
OL,13,F"The UK was simply not prepared. Too
OL,14,Fmany lives were cut short," the
OL,15,Finquiry's chairwoman says - see her
OL,16,Fnine recommendations
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/41
