OL,3,AUK 'effectively blind' to early Covid
OL,4,Aspread due to lack of test and trace,
OL,5,Ainquiry finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite British scientists developing a
OL,8,Fhighly accurate test for Covid in
OL,9,FJanuary 2020, the government was forced
OL,10,Fto abandon community testing in March
OL,11,F2020 at a critical moment, the inquiry
OL,12,Fsays
OL,14,FIt also finds the UK lacked a clear
OL,15,Fstrategy for implementing border
OL,16,Fcontrol measures early in the pandemic,
OL,17,Fleaving the country in an "extremely
OL,18,Fvulnerable position"
OL,20,FThe lack of support to help people
OL,21,Fself-isolate is among five key failings
OL,22,Fidentified
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
