OL,3,ATrump, Putin, and Xi issue 'joint
OL,4,Adeclaration on peace' after 90-minute
OL,5,Atalks in China
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing the summit, Putin says Kyiv
OL,8,Fand Europe are not yet ready to
OL,9,Fcompromise to resolve the war in
OL,10,FUkraine
OL,12,FWhen pressed by the BBC in the news
OL,13,Fconference, he challenges the idea that
OL,14,FRussia is the aggressor in the war
OL,16,FEarlier, Trump held separate, bilateral
OL,17,Fmeetings with Putin and Xi. He called
OL,18,Fthe Russian leader his friend - watch
OL,19,Fthe moment here
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/41
