OL,3,ADozens missing after boat carrying 100
OL,4,Amigrants sinks off Senegal's coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenegalese authorities are continuing
OL,7,Fsearch operations after a boat
OL,8,Freportedly carrying about 100 migrants
OL,9,Fcapsized off the coast.
OL,11,FInitial reports said that one person
OL,12,Fhad died, but some local media have
OL,13,Freported that at least four bodies have
OL,14,Fbeen recovered. Dozens of people are
OL,15,Fstill missing.
OL,17,FPersonal belongings were found on the
OL,18,Fbadly damaged boat, which washed ashore
OL,19,Fnear the village of Yenne, south of
OL,20,FDakar. Search operations continued
OL,21,Fthroughout Wednesday and were due to
OL,22,Fresume on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/41
